npc Beachcomber 10 5 farmer Found an old boat hull under the sand once. Lake swallows everything eventually. | Curious beachcomber who collects things washed up by the lake. Speaks in a rambling, friendly way. Has found strange artifacts and bones. Believes the lake is bottomless.
